config BR2_PACKAGE_CCLESTE
	bool "ccleste"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SDL2
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SDL2_MIXER
	select BR2_PACKAGE_TREMOR
	help
	  ccleste: a C source port of Celeste Classic, the PICO-8
	  original Maddy Thorson and Noel Berry wrote for Ludum Dare -
	  the cart's Lua translated to C by hand, so the game runs
	  natively rather than under a PICO-8 emulator. The game logic
	  needs nothing but libc; SDL2 and SDL2_mixer provide the video
	  and audio frontend.

	  Tremor is selected because it is the only Ogg Vorbis decoder
	  Buildroot's sdl2_mixer can be built against, and the
	  soundtrack ships as .ogg.

	  https://github.com/lemon32767/ccleste
